      "placement": "bot",
      "activity": null,
      "traits": [],
      "entries": [
        "The soul swarm reaches out and tries to tear at the spiritual energy of enemies within 5 feet (DC 32 basic Reflex save). The soul swarm can choose to deal slashing damage as it cuts away at a creature, fire damage as it burns other souls away, or negative damage as it attempts to unmake a soul. The damage depends on the number of actions. 1 2d6+1 damage 2 4d6+11 damage 3 6d6+11 damage"
